<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indonesian foreign exchange market was closed on Friday for the Easter holiday.</p>
<p>The market will also be closed on Monday, the last day of the 1996-97 fiscal year, and will reopen April 1.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the rupiah last traded at 2,400/2,403 against the dollar against an opening of 2,401.50/02.50.</p>
